        "heading_size": "h2",
        "section_title": "",
        "section_description": "<img src=\"http://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0673/4063/2201/files/shilajit_liquid_drop.webp?v=1758880217\">\n<p>Most liquid supplements are measured by the milliliter — which requires a marked dropper, good lighting, and a steady eye. Three drops requires none of that. The dropper controls the dose. You just count.</p>",
