        "slide_fFdGcG": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 1 - 2",
            "slide_heading": "The Beginning",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>Three drops of pure Himalayan shilajit liquid drops, same time, every day. The compounds in the liquid are being introduced to the system for the first time — same dose, same time, building from day one.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nSome people notice a shift in how their mornings feel during this window. Others don't notice anything yet. Both are normal. The compounds are present. The process has started.\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        "slide_VUR3wa": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 3 - 10",
            "slide_heading": "Where Most People Notice",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>By this point the daily dose has had enough time to accumulate. Shilajit liquid form taken consistently, same three drops, every single day, has been the only variable.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nThis is the period most customers reach out to us. Reports during this stretch tend to mention recovery and focus. The routine has had enough time to become part of the day.\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        "slide_8E6BHW": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 11+",
            "slide_heading": "When It Becomes Routine",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>\nAt this point, three drops of liquid shilajit a day has become routine rather than effort. Most people at this stage stop thinking about it. The drops are part of the morning. The routine just works.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\n  <strong><em>Individual experiences vary. These are general observations shared by customers, not guaranteed outcomes. For best results, take daily without skipping.</em></strong>\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        }
