      "settings": {
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "section_title": "<brown> THREE DROPS. </brown>\nEVERY TIME.",
        "section_description": "<p>\nThe dose doesn't change. Three drops is 0.2ml — the same every morning, whether the bottle is full or nearly empty. No recalibrating. No estimating. The dropper decides.\nSqueeze once, release slowly. Count three drops. That is the entire technique.\n</p>\n<p><strong><i>\nConsult a doctor before use if pregnant, nursing, or on any medication. Keep out of reach of children. Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</i></strong>\n</p>",
